input_prompt: Explain what on-device AI means in simple terms.
On-device AI, or in-device AI, means that artificial intelligence is performed directly on the device where the user is interacting with the application or service. This is in contrast to cloud-based AI, where processing takes place in the cloud and data is sent to servers for processing. On-device AI is typically faster and more energy-efficient, but may have limited processing power and memory compared to cloud-based AI.

